icrosecond","c":[]},{"h":"Supports 3.6 Terabits per second (Tbps) of Bandwidth","c":[]},{"h":"Condition: Used (Fresh Condition)","c":[]},{"h":"Warranty: 1 Year","c":[]}],"noExpand":false},"tabs":[{"title":"Description","active":true,"cls":"tab-2","noExpand":false,"kind":"description","html":"\n                <p>The <strong data-start=\"248\" data-end=\"284\">Cisco Nexus 9300 N9K-C93180YC-EX</strong> is a high-performance, fixed-form factor <strong data-start=\"326\" data-end=\"348\">data center switch</strong> designed for modern enterprise and cloud networks. This 1RU switch delivers <strong data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"457\">48 × 1/10/25-GbE SFP28 ports</strong> and <strong data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"500\">6 × 40/100-GbE QSFP28 uplink ports</strong>, offering up to <strong data-start=\"517\" data-end=\"551\">3.6 Tbps of switching capacity</strong> and <strong data-start=\"556\" data-end=\"577\">ultra-low latency</strong>. Running on <strong data-start=\"590\" data-end=\"605\">Cisco NX-OS</strong>, the N9K-C93180YC-EX supports <strong data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"692\">VXLAN, BGP EVPN, automation, and real-time telemetry</strong>, making it ideal for <strong data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"773\">high-density, scalable, and secure network environments</strong>. With <strong data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"836\">redundant hot-swappable power supplies and fan trays</strong>, it ensures high availability and reliability for business-critical workloads.</p><h3><br></h3><h3>Key Features:</h3><p>\n\n</p><ul><li>Model: Cisco Nexus N9K-C93180YC-EX</li><li>Form Factor: 1RU fixed switch</li><li>Interfaces: 48 × 1/10/25-GbE SFP28, 6 × 40/100-GbE QSFP28</li><li>Switching Capacity: Up to 3.6 Tbps</li><li>Forwarding Rate: Up to 2.6 Bpps</li><li>Latency: Sub-1 µs</li><li>Buffer: 40 MB shared buffer</li><li>Redundancy: Dual hot-swappable power supplies and fan trays</li><li>Software: Cisco NX-OS, ACI-ready</li></ul><p></p>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false